WEBVTT

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:33.976
I ate really small controlled portions
throughout the day.

00:08:34.000 --> 00:08:38.197
And I started to really adapt my body.

00:08:38.221 --> 00:08:40.363
[Individual results may vary]

00:08:40.387 --> 00:08:42.976
(Laughter)

00:08:43.000 --> 00:08:46.625
The thinner I was, the longer
I was able to hold my breath.

00:08:46.649 --> 00:08:49.976
And by eating so well
and training so hard,

00:08:50.000 --> 00:08:53.500
my resting heart-rate dropped
to 38 beats per minute.

00:08:53.524 --> 00:08:55.728
Which is lower than most Olympic athletes.

00:08:57.041 --> 00:08:58.591
In four months of training,

00:08:58.615 --> 00:09:01.088
I was able to hold my breath
for over seven minutes.